   "text": "every full switch-out writes the vault - Status, Weekly, domain\nfiles - real tokens, every boundary, every project. readers:\nZERO. no human opens Obsidian (all three users, interviewed\n2026-08-06); no machine reads it (write-only by design). one\nuser hit session limits MID-switch-out paying this bill.",
