   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Status.md -> duplicated in repo (CONTEXT + newest log).\nWeekly.md -> re-curation of repo records; deliberate save.\nMOC -> static index; deliberate save.\ndomain files (Architecture, Playbook, guides) -> human-curated\nre-statements; vault-only prose kept via deliberate save.\npeople/ -> VAULT-ONLY, the genuine residue - untouched, writable.\nclient/engagement/research slots -> vault-only where they exist.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Status.md -> duplicated in repo (CONTEXT + newest log).\nWeekly.md -> re-curation of repo records; deliberate save.\nMOC -> static index; deliberate save.\ndomain files (Architecture, Playbook, guides) -> human-curated\nre-statements; vault-only prose kept via deliberate save.\npeople/ -> VAULT-ONLY, the genuine residue - untouched, writable.\nclient/engagement/research slots -> vault-only where they exist.",
