   "roundness": null,
   "text": "switch SKILL.md (the bulk): step 4 deleted + renumber; modifier\ntable drops the Vault row; description, intro, usage, triage,\nfallback all drop vault language; banner gains ONE conditional\nline when vault.json exists ('vault not written - on-demand').\nkivna SKILL.md: ONE sentence added (save is deliberate; switch\nno longer calls it). tend SKILL.md: Cat-3 missing-vault nag ->\ninfo line; present vault keeps every check. vault-spec: opt-in\nsentence in Ownership. plus README x3 sections, v0.83.0.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "switch SKILL.md (the bulk): step 4 deleted + renumber; modifier\ntable drops the Vault row; description, intro, usage, triage,\nfallback all drop vault language; banner gains ONE conditional\nline when vault.json exists ('vault not written - on-demand').\nkivna SKILL.md: ONE sentence added (save is deliberate; switch\nno longer calls it). tend SKILL.md: Cat-3 missing-vault nag ->\ninfo line; present vault keeps every check. vault-spec: opt-in\nsentence in Ownership. plus README x3 sections, v0.83.0.",
