   "roundness": null,
   "text": "BOUNDARY AUTO-SIZING (light/low die): Backlog, own slice -\nthe modifier table's shape is left alone bar the vault row.\nCYCLE AUTOMATION (out -> clear -> in): Backlog High, own frame.\nKIVNA VERDICT (import/export/scaffold archaeology): Backlog.\nVAULT DELETION OR MIGRATION: never in this slice.\nSCHEDULED SAVES: only if the stale-insurance trigger fires.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "BOUNDARY AUTO-SIZING (light/low die): Backlog, own slice -\nthe modifier table's shape is left alone bar the vault row.\nCYCLE AUTOMATION (out -> clear -> in): Backlog High, own frame.\nKIVNA VERDICT (import/export/scaffold archaeology): Backlog.\nVAULT DELETION OR MIGRATION: never in this slice.\nSCHEDULED SAVES: only if the stale-insurance trigger fires.",
   "autoResize": true,
